  "_instructions": [
    "1. Edit all values above to customize your chain.",
    "2. Run: python3 scripts/launch_chain.py --config chainbrand.json",
    "3. Or run interactively: python3 scripts/launch_chain.py",
    "4. Generate a template config: python3 scripts/launch_chain.py --generate-config > chainbrand.json",
    "5. Choose unique magic_bytes to avoid collision with other chains.",
    "6. Set mine_genesis=true to mine new genesis blocks (requires x11_hash module).",
    "7. Set generate_spork_keys=true to generate new spork signing keys.",
    "8. After launch, add seed nodes to src/chainparamsseeds.h and checkpoints to src/chainparams.cpp."
